        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "db6c0cbf-6416-3d75-84a0-69cf7c978840",
                "word": "deceptie",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "bd682ea7-52a7-4438-8e9d-21ee13ba66f1",
                        "entry_id": "db6c0cbf-6416-3d75-84a0-69cf7c978840",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "decepties"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f57220f4-0c73-3272-b5b5-15466ffeca5b",
                        "entry_id": "db6c0cbf-6416-3d75-84a0-69cf7c978840",
                        "glosses": [
                            "dat iets helemaal niet aan je verwachtingen voldoet"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3bbbef4c-3dd1-43b2-8e21-3aa6f4d633a5",
                                "sense_id": "f57220f4-0c73-3272-b5b5-15466ffeca5b",
                                "text": "Edith en haar vriendin zijn speciaal in Parijs gebleven om te kunnen stemmen, voor hen was blanco stemmen geen optie. “We zijn goede burgers.” Zestiger Jean-Pierre Cieslak heeft de blanco stem wel overwogen. Hij stemde in de eerste ronde voor “een kleine kandidaat”- wie, dat wil hij niet zeggen. Uiteindelijk besloot hij vandaag toch op een van de twee overgebleven kandidaten te stemmen, ondanks zijn deceptie in het politieke systeem."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb1c7423-57d8-4f61-b152-cd573ce5d519",
                                "sense_id": "f57220f4-0c73-3272-b5b5-15466ffeca5b",
                                "text": "Van Oostveen, architect van de Hiddink/Blind-constructie, werd niet weggestuurd maar kreeg er eind 2015 vier jaar bij van de raad van commissarissen. En Blind mocht op zijn beurt van diezelfde Van Oostveen ook door. Een deceptie van historische proporties kreeg zo - behalve het eerdere ontslag van Hiddink toen Oranje nog op koers lag voor het EK - te weinig consequenties."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cd1f2be3-8ff5-4b6e-87ae-cb53800fd20c",
                        "source_entry_id": "db6c0cbf-6416-3d75-84a0-69cf7c978840",
                        "source_sense_id": "f57220f4-0c73-3272-b5b5-15466ffeca5b",
                        "source_sense_description": "dat iets niet aan je verwachtingen voldoet",
                        "target_lang_word": "deception",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "deception",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2959c897-fe1b-34ff-8f10-9890d2bb5dca",
                                        "entry_id": "dafe6e5e-a27d-33ab-aaf3-e955869b0cf6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of actions and/or schemes fabricated to mislead someone into believing a lie or inaccuracy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9e1d366-1671-475e-9170-c91f7566a822",
                                                "sense_id": "2959c897-fe1b-34ff-8f10-9890d2bb5dca",
                                                "text": "deliberate deception"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c877aa76-05a8-4741-af58-08112bc2957e",
                                                "sense_id": "2959c897-fe1b-34ff-8f10-9890d2bb5dca",
                                                "text": "pure deception"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "523e19ef-db91-4db2-8eb1-cf70f8a023c3",
                                                "sense_id": "2959c897-fe1b-34ff-8f10-9890d2bb5dca",
                                                "text": "She got the money out of the tourist by deception."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba2a2921-7c30-4b0a-b4b4-944657f0db8d",
                                                "sense_id": "2959c897-fe1b-34ff-8f10-9890d2bb5dca",
                                                "text": "The Priest also places a moral barrier between himself and his tale by establishing himself as an \"unreliable narrator\" capable of deception and irony. Thus, through his habit of speaking equivocally, he can disavow responsibility for his frequently provocative words."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15c80ffe-2fac-4e76-9901-67fcf1db70c7",
                                                "sense_id": "2959c897-fe1b-34ff-8f10-9890d2bb5dca",
                                                "text": "Reports related to Trump’s second impeachment very well reflect the Trumpology of the last four years – lie as much as you find tolerable (and the tolerance levels have been moved out extensively), and cover the truth with more lies and deception.[…]Lies, deceit and corruption – the core of Trumpology."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3514c310-f1ef-4f40-bebe-7dea4b96905c",
                                                "sense_id": "2959c897-fe1b-34ff-8f10-9890d2bb5dca",
                                                "text": "The movie delivers a critical and analytical 'unfolding of the circumstances of Reality [Winner]’s life, starting with her childhood in Texas, in order to reveal her sense of deceptions and injustices that pass largely unchallenged in everyday American life."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
